ond sun.","cites":["hour-glory-2017-06-21-e0"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21#:~:text=And%20so%20the%20great%20God%2DPharaoh%20forged%20the%20gods."],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Hour of Glory","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-06-21","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21#:~:text=And%20so%20the%20great%20God%2DPharaoh%20forged%20the%20gods.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Hour of Glory\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 21 Jun 2017."}]},{"text":"Each god oversees one of the five trials and instructs the initiates preparing to face it.","cites":["amonkhet-plane-e1"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/story/amonkhet-plane#:~:text=Each%20god%20oversees%20one,to%20face%20the%20trial"],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Amonkhet","series":"Magic: The Gathering story profiles","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/story/amonkhet-plane","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/story/amonkhet-plane#:~:text=Each%20god%20oversees%20one,to%20face%20the%20trial","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Amonkhet\". Magic: The Gathering story profiles, Wizards of the Coast."}]},{"text":"In Hazoret's final Trial, all the gods approached as Hazoret took Samut and the Gatewatch to face the last initiates.","cites":["judgment-2017-05-17-e14"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/judgment-2017-05-17#:~:text=Your%20time%20has%20come"],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Judgment","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Alison Lührs","Doug Beyer"],"date":"2017-05-17","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/judgment-2017-05-17","link":"https://magic